  "description": "The Crew Mini-X is built for riders who think “maybe I shouldn’t” — and then do it anyway. Packing serious power into a compact electric pit bike, it delivers aggressive acceleration, effortless wheelies, and a top speed that’s way beyond what something this small has any business doing. Inspired by classic pit bikes with a little BMX attitude mixed in, the Mini-X keeps the playful mini bike feel but adds enough punch to get you into (and out of) trouble quickly.\nAt its core is a 1000W hub motor powered by a 52V 17Ah lithium-ion battery, delivering strong torque and speeds up to 32 mph — which feels even faster when you’re sitting this close to the pavement. 4-piston hydraulic disc brakes provide the stopping power to match the fun, so you can ride hard with confidence when things get rowdy. With its pit bike attitude, compact stance, and surprisingly high performance, the Crew Mini-X is made for riders who want maximum fun in a minimum-size package… and probably shouldn’t be trusted with it.",
